fa_declaration.summary.body:
The KBO FA declaration window for the {season} season has closed. {declared_count} player(s) filed for free agency, while {deferred_count} eligible player(s) stayed with their original clubs for now.

Declared FA players
{declared_list}
Deferred candidates
{deferred_list}
Among the non-filers, {retry_count} were classified as retrying after a down year and {no_market_count} were classified as staying because the market was unlikely to meet their needs.
